# Requirements
# - VSCodeプラグイン REST Client

### シナリオ1 複数拠点 企業全体
POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/report/cn-karte/create/vis
Authorization: Bearer TEST_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "corporate_number":"2025071400001",
    "start_year":"2025",
    "start_month":"04",
    "creation_format":"1",
    "org_id":"TEP",
    "agreement_category":"01",
    "need_data_insufficiency_list":"True",
    "need_report_backdata":"False",
    "need_kpi_list":"True",
    "is_for_multibuilding":"True"
}

